# Runtime data (sqlite, generated assets, model cache).
# ANCHORED on purpose: a bare `data/` also matches `backend/app/data/`, which holds the
# committed model catalogue (app/data/models.json). Ignoring that made every fresh
# clone unbootable — CI found it, because the agent's working tree had the file.
/data/
/backend/data/
